<span id="A1.SS3.p3.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p3.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Are these sentences consistent? (yes/no). Response:<span id="A1.SS3.p3.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
